---
description: Architecture constraints
alwaysApply: true
---
Read `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`. Use one Next.js modular monolith, one PostgreSQL
account system and one Stripe customer identity per person. Keep Courses and
Rooms as separate domains with explicit shared interfaces. Use Drizzle and small
provider adapters; keep core data portable. No microservices or provider-coupled
DB/auth patterns. Prefer Server Components. Transactional email follows
`docs/EMAIL.md` and `composeTransactionalEmail()`; do not add a second mail
provider.
